flowchart TB
    Public[Public Web: Astro] --> Tools[Guest deterministic tools]
    User[User App: React] --> BFF[Worker BFF + identity boundary]
    Pro[Practice / Organization / Partner] --> BFF
    BFF --> Auth[Account / Subject / Grant / Purpose / Entitlement]
    Auth --> Profile[Versioned profile + hypotheses]
    Profile --> Core[Canonical TypeScript method core]
    Core --> Claims[Typed claims + provenance]
    Journal[Observation + Resonance] --> Claims
    Claims --> AI[Authorized retrieval / Writer / Reviewer]
    AI --> Snap[Reviewed report snapshot + action plan]
    Snap --> Jobs[Transactional outbox / Queues / receipt]
    Jobs --> Files[Sandbox renderer / Private R2]
    Auth --> PG[(PostgreSQL + RLS)]
    PG --> Jobs
    Sources[Source / edition / rights / release registry] --> Core
    Sources --> AI
    Policy[Country + safety policy: deny wins] --> Auth
    Policy --> AI
